    "body": "`awaitAgent` says terminal states include `terminated`/`failed`, but session statuses appear to be `idle|busy|paused|error` (and termination currently sets status back to `idle`). Consider updating this description (and any related terminal-state vocabulary) so agents don’t treat `terminated`/`failed` as distinct states when they won’t occur.",
